	"commissionName": "NSLOCTEXT(\"[70199B914E7E03A9706A1499CF20B1FD]\", \"63DCF3EC459CFC5AA6C032AA2C0E95D7\", \"Up the River\")",
	"flavorText": "NSLOCTEXT(\"[70199B914E7E03A9706A1499CF20B1FD]\", \"54CD8A0D4FEC70D308255C8F712BA91B\", \"Carried on the winds from my childhood home on Sanctus, I am flung to Verra\\'s wonders. Essence is thick in the air, and in my heart. While the Dunir return to the mountain\\'s breast, my kin regroup outside on the banks of the mountain watershed, at a place called Bonfire.Grabber machines now menace the mountain interior, their once-helpful forms corrupted and hostile. Silae Nohotu bid me find Malae Kelori. She guards a river post on the way to Bonfire, holding the line against the machines. Their purpose remains unclear. Are they broken, or twisted by some hidden force? Old enemies like the the Ramkin still stir at the edges as well. I must find Malae, and speak with her.\")",
	"mainObjectiveText": "NSLOCTEXT(\"[70199B914E7E03A9706A1499CF20B1FD]\", \"6A714DBC4D77D968D4395DB25B1C1F38\", \"Report to Malae Kelori\")",
